        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for powerpc-utils",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for powerpc-utils fixes the following issues:\n\n- Start SMT service after networking (bsc#1249152 ltc#214730)\n- Fix inconsistent Core Online/Offline States Observed in lscpu and\n  ppc64_cpu --info Command Outputs During DLPAR Operation (bsc#1246126 ltc#214064)\n- Fix HNV installation network conflicts across all distributions (jsc#PED-3946)\n- Fix negative values of idle PURR (bsc#1238322 ltc#210808)\n\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
      {
